                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hanna</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-07-18T19:00:00-04:00">July 18, 1930—7
                    p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>68. Your despatch No. 72, June 26. Please continue your discussions and keep
                    Department informed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
